msgstr "Accès refusé - accès du personnel requis"

#: menu_api_views.py:55
msgid "Create a new menu"
msgstr "Créer un nouveau menu"

#: menu_api_views.py:56
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Creates a new navigation menu.\n"
"\n"
"        **Use Cases:**\n"
"        - Create new menu from menu builder\n"
"        - Programmatically add menus\n"
"\n"
"        **Authentication:** Staff session required\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Crée un nouveau menu de navigation. **Cas d'utilisation :** - Créer "
"un nouveau menu à partir du constructeur de menu - Ajouter des menus de "
"manière programmatique **Authentification :** Session d'employé requise\n"
"        "

#: menu_api_views.py:68 menu_api_views.py:121 menu_api_views.py:136
#: menu_api_views.py:189 menu_api_views.py:204 menu_api_views.py:256
#: menu_api_views.py:302 menu_api_views.py:727
msgid "Validation error"
msgstr "Erreur de validation"

#: menu_api_views.py:87
msgid "Get menu with full item tree"
msgstr "Obtenir le menu avec l'arborescence complète des éléments"

#: menu_api_views.py:88
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Returns complete menu details including all items in a nested tree "
"structure.\n"
"\n"
"        The `items_tree` field contains menu items with their children "
"nested,\n"
"        suitable for rendering in the visual menu builder.\n"
"\n"
"        **Use Cases:**\n"
"        - Load menu data for visual builder\n"
"        - Retrieve complete menu structure for rendering\n"
"\n"
"        **Authentication:** Staff session required\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Retourne les détails complets du menu, y compris tous les éléments "
"dans une structure d'arbre imbriquée. Le champ `items_tree` contient les "
"éléments du menu avec leurs enfants imbriqués, adaptés à l'affichage dans le "
"constructeur de menu visuel. **Cas d'utilisation :** - Charger les données "
"de menu pour le constructeur visuel - Récupérer la structure complète du "
"menu pour l'affichage **Authentification :** Session membre du personnel "
"requise\n"
"        "

#: menu_api_views.py:102 menu_api_views.py:122 menu_api_views.py:137
#: menu_api_views.py:152 menu_api_views.py:499 menu_api_views.py:728
msgid "Menu not found"
msgstr "Menu non trouvé"

#: menu_api_views.py:107
msgid "Update menu settings"
msgstr "Mettre à jour les paramètres du menu"

#: menu_api_views.py:108
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Updates menu properties (name, location, display type, styling).\n"
"\n"
"        Does NOT update menu items - use the menu items endpoints for that.\n"
"\n"
"        **Authentication:** Staff session required\n"
"\n"
"        **Side Effects:**\n"
"        - Clears cached menu renders\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Met à jour les propriétés du menu (nom, emplacement, type "
"d'affichage, style). NE MET PAS À JOUR LES ÉLÉMENTS DE MENU - utilisez les "
"points de terminaison des éléments de menu à cet effet. **Authentification :"
"** Session d'employé requise **Effets secondaires :** - Efface les rendus de "
"menu en cache\n"
"        "

#: menu_api_views.py:127
msgid "Partially update menu settings"
msgstr "Mettre à jour partiellement les paramètres du menu"

#: menu_api_views.py:128
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Partially updates menu properties.\n"
"\n"
"        **Authentication:** Staff session required\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Met à jour partiellement les propriétés du menu. **Authentication:** "
"Session d'employé requise\n"
"        "

#: menu_api_views.py:142
#: templates/admin/design/menu/partials/menu_cards.html:115
msgid "Delete menu"
msgstr "Supprimer le menu"

#: menu_api_views.py:143
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Deletes a menu and all its items.\n"
"\n"
"        **Authentication:** Staff session required\n"
"\n"
"        **Warning:** This action cannot be undone.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Supprime un menu et tous ses éléments. **Authentication:** Session "
"d'employé requise **Warning:** Cette action ne peut pas être annulée.\n"
"        "

#: menu_api_views.py:151
msgid "Menu deleted"
msgstr "Menu supprimé"

#: menu_api_views.py:167
msgid "Get menu item details"
msgstr "Obtenir les détails de l'élément de menu"

#: menu_api_views.py:168
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Returns details of a specific menu item.\n"
"\n"
"        **Authentication:** Staff session required\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Retourne les détails d'un élément de menu spécifique. "
"**Authentication:** Session d'employé requise\n"
"        "

#: menu_api_views.py:175 menu_api_views.py:190 menu_api_views.py:205
#: menu_api_views.py:220
msgid "Menu item not found"
msgstr "Élément de menu non trouvé"

#: menu_api_views.py:180
msgid "Update menu item"
msgstr "Mettre à jour l'élément de menu"

#: menu_api_views.py:181
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Updates a menu item's properties.\n"
"\n"
"        **Authentication:** Staff session required\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Met à jour les propriétés d'un élément de menu. **Authentification :"
"** session d'employé requise\n"
"        "

#: menu_api_views.py:195
msgid "Partially update menu item"
msgstr "Mettre à jour partiellement l'élément de menu"

#: menu_api_views.py:196
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Partially updates a menu item's properties.\n"
"\n"
"        **Authentication:** Staff session required\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Met à jour partiellement les propriétés d'un élément de menu. "
"**Authentification :** session d'employé requise\n"
"        "

#: menu_api_views.py:210
msgid "Delete menu item"
msgstr "Supprimer l'élément de menu"

#: menu_api_views.py:211
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Deletes a menu item and all its children.\n"
"\n"
"        **Authentication:** Staff session required\n"
"\n"
"        **Warning:** Child items will also be deleted.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        Supprime un élément de menu et tous ses enfants. **Authentification :"
"** session d'employé requise **Avertissement :** les éléments enfants seront "
"également supprimés.\n"
"        "

#: menu_api_views.py:219
msgid "Menu item deleted"
msgstr "Élément de menu supprimé"

#: menu_api_views.py:238
msgid "Create menu item"
msgstr "Créer un élément de menu"

#: menu_api_views.py:239
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Creates a new menu item.\n"
"\n"
"    **Item Types:**\n"
"    - `link`: Standard link with URL\n"
"    - `page`: Link to a Page (uses page_reference)\n"
"    - `category`: Link to a Category (uses category_reference)\n"
"    - `custom_url`: Custom URL link\n"
"    - `divider`: Visual divider/separator\n"
"    - `header`: Section header (non-clickable)\n"
"    - `widget`: Widget item (login/logout, cart, account)\n"
"\n"
"    **Authentication:** Staff session required\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Creates a new menu item.\n"
"\n"
"    **Item Types:**\n"
"    - `link`: Standard link with URL\n"
"    - `page`: Link to a Page (uses page_reference)\n"
"    - `category`: Link to a Category (uses category_reference)\n"
"    - `custom_url`: Custom URL link\n"
"    - `divider`: Visual divider/separator\n"
"    - `header`: Section header (non-clickable)\n"
"    - `widget`: Widget item (login/logout, cart, account)\n"
"\n"
"    **Authentication:** Staff session required\n"
"    "

#: menu_api_views.py:273
msgid "Reorder menu items"
msgstr "Réordonner les éléments de menu"

#: menu_api_views.py:274
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Batch reorder menu items, supporting drag-and-drop operations.\n"
"\n"
"    Accepts an array of item updates with new order and parent values.\n"
"\n"
"    **Request Body:**\n"
"    ```json\n"
"    {\n"
"        \"items\": [\n"
"            {\"id\": 1, \"order\": 0, \"parent_id\": null},\n"
"            {\"id\": 2, \"order\": 1, \"parent_id\": null},\n"
"            {\"id\": 3, \"order\": 0, \"parent_id\": 2}\n"
"        ]\n"
"    }\n"
"    ```\n"
"\n"
"    **Use Cases:**\n"
"    - Save drag-and-drop reordering from visual builder\n"
"    - Batch update item hierarchy\n"
"\n"
"    **Authentication:** Staff session required\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Batch reorder menu items, supporting drag-and-drop operations.\n"
"\n"
"    Accepts an array of item updates with new order and parent values.\n"
"\n"
"    **Request Body:**\n"
"    ```json\n"
"    {\n"
"        \"items\": [\n"
"            {\"id\": 1, \"order\": 0, \"parent_id\": null},\n"
"            {\"id\": 2, \"order\": 1, \"parent_id\": null},\n"
"            {\"id\": 3, \"order\": 0, \"parent_id\": 2}\n"
"        ]\n"
"    }\n"
"    ```\n"
"\n"
"    **Use Cases:**\n"
"    - Save drag-and-drop reordering from visual builder\n"
"    - Batch update item hierarchy\n"
"\n"
"    **Authentication:** Staff session required\n"
"    "

#: menu_api_views.py:299
msgid "Items reordered successfully"
msgstr "Éléments réordonnés avec succès"

#: menu_api_views.py:335
msgid "Get available link sources for quick-add"
msgstr "Obtenir les sources de lien disponibles pour l'ajout rapide"

#: menu_api_views.py:336
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Returns available pages and categories for quick-adding as menu items.\n"
"\n"
"    **Query Parameters:**\n"
"    - `type`: Filter by source type (`pages`, `categories`, or `all`)\n"
"    - `search`: Search term to filter results\n"
"\n"
"    **Use Cases:**\n"
"    - Populate quick-add panel in menu builder\n"
"    - Search for pages/categories to add as menu items\n"
"\n"
"    **Authentication:** Staff session required\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Retourne les pages et catégories disponibles pour un ajout rapide en "
"tant qu'éléments de menu. **Paramètres de requête :** - `type` : Filtre par "
"type de source (`pages`, `categories` ou `all`) - `search` : Terme de "
"recherche pour filtrer les résultats **Cas d'utilisation :** - Remplir le "
"panneau d'ajout rapide dans le constructeur de menu - Rechercher des pages/"
"catégories à ajouter en tant qu'éléments de menu **Authentification :** "
"Session d'employé requise\n"
"    "

